{"id":"u-42faa07f-6107-4ec2-aeb3-9d982568ddfb","src":"community","title":"Lazy-5/3/1","author":"Ismael","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/PlGXvT-lazy-531","desc":"Eases you into the 531 routine with just 3x a week after years of laziness.\n\nGo ahead and guess your 1RM. No it's not close to your last attempt from 3 years ago. Try 65% of it. Maybe 69%. \n\nDon't worry, you'll get back to it quickly. Well maybe not, but who cares. Take your time. \n\n4 weeks per cycle.\n\nDo 1, maybe 2. \n\nWeek 1:\n- Low volume.\n- You'll probably want to be done after main lifts.  That's cool, skip the accessory lifts this time. \n\nWeek 2:\n- Still low volume because lazy, but more weight.\n- Add a superset from accessories after main lifts.\n\nWeek 3:\n- Starting to look familiar. Maybe not since you can't remember. \n- Don't stop\n\nWeek 4:\n- 5/3/1 lite with second set last (SSL)\n- Still only 3x a week.\n\nIf you run it a second time, use your new 1RM estimates, obviously.  Don't run this for more than 2 cycles. Or do?","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:26:59.756Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Deadlift + Front Squat","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Sumo Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":55},{"r":5,"pct":70},{"r":5,"pct":80,"x":3}]},{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Glute Bridge (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Shrug (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":55},{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":3,"pct":75,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":50},{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":3}]},{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets"